msgid "getPreviousPage() & getNextPage()"
msgstr "getPreviousPage() & getNextPage()"

#: ../../source/libraries/pagination.rst:302
msgid ""
"These methods return a **URL** for the previous and next pages in "
"relation to the current page being displayed."
