"``getFirstPageNumber()`` will return 3 while ``getLastPageNumber()`` will"
" return 7."
msgstr "``getFirstPageNumber()``\ 는 3을 반환하고 ``getLastPageNumber()``\ 는 7을 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/libraries/pagination.rst:330
msgid ""
"To obtain the page numbers of the first and last pages in the entire "
"result set, you can use the following approach: The first page number is "
"always 1, and `getPageCount()`_ can be used to retrieve the last page "
